      "statement": "Mainline gadget code is stored as a real git object database (SHA-1, zlib-deflated loose objects) in the overseer's gitObjects typed-storage collection, with no ref layer: gadget records, blueprint records, and chat pins act as refs, and content addressing deduplicates related histories at the blob/tree level.",
